Program          : DRVEC 0.12
Input Data File  : the .pre files
Output File      : ewin.out
Model            : VARMA-VECM(2,0), M = 2 series, cointegration rank r = 1
Estimation       : Exact Unconditional Maximum Likelihood, Algorithm AS 311 (Mauricio 1997), xi sequence truncated at 1e-3
Transformation   : VECM to stationary VARMA (Mauricio 2006)
Deterministic    : case 2 -- E[nabla Y2] = 0, E[W] free
Structure        : F free, Theta absent (q = 0), Sigma free
Series           : muskrat mink   (1 in the nabla Y2 block, 1 in Y1)
Sample           : 50 observations from 1862, annual (raw 62)

=== The ladder below the rank: r = 0, from the gate up ===
  rung 0  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma diag)   logL = -26.9710756998

=== Entry gate: the factorisation contract ===

At r = 0 with diagonal Phi, Theta and Sigma the likelihood factorises,
so the joint fit must equal the sum of the univariate fits exactly.

  univariate 1 (p=2, q=0)   logL =     -13.9503719107
  univariate 2 (p=2, q=0)   logL =     -13.0207037891
                                 sum  =     -26.9710756998
                                 joint=     -26.9710756998
  (both sides untruncated; the fit's own logL, xi truncated at 1e-03, is -26.9710756998)

  crossing identity (joint - sum) = -5.301e-12   (tolerance 1.0e-06)   VERIFIED
  rung 1  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma free)   logL = -23.2783661447
  rung 2  (F free, Theta free, Sigma free)   logL = -4.2019654157

